OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day, with some evening
OL,7,Fsunshine. Staying largely dry with
OL,8,Fsome clear spells overnight. Cloud
OL,9,Fincreasing from the northwest by
OL,10,Fmorning. Perhaps some patchy drizzle
OL,11,Falong southern coasts. A warm and
OL,12,Fhumid night. Breezy.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FFriday morning will be cloudy
OL,15,Fwith patchy drizzle giving way to some
OL,16,Fmore persistent light rain at times
OL,17,Ffrom the northwest. Brightening up
OL,18,Flater in the day, though feeling
OL,19,Ffresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
